---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import '../../styles/pages.css';
---
<Base title="Privacy and your data" description="What the Mulligan Games site saves when you send a form, why it uses no analytics or ad trackers, and how to ask us to delete your data.">
  <div class="wrap prose">
    <header class="page-head">
      <h1>Privacy</h1>
      <p class="page-lede">Short version: we store what you type into a form so the shop can answer it. No analytics, no ad trackers.</p>
      <p class="muted">Last updated: November 19, 2026</p>
    </header>

    <section aria-labelledby="forms-h">
      <h2 id="forms-h">What each form stores</h2>
      <p>Each form saves one row (or a few) in the shop's database. Nothing else about you is saved with it.</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Event sign-up:</strong> the event, your first name, your email, an optional note, and whether you are on the waitlist.</li>
        <li><strong>Card request:</strong> your first name, your email, the game, and the cards you listed.</li>
        <li><strong>Buylist:</strong> your name, your email, cash or store credit, an optional note, and each card row (name, set, condition, quantity).</li>
        <li><strong>Contact:</strong> your name, your email and your message.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>Each row also gets the time it was sent. Rows stay until the store deletes them.</p>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="track-h">
      <h2 id="track-h">What we do not do</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>No analytics and no advertising trackers.</li>
        <li>No accounts and no cookies set by this site.</li>
        <li>The one thing saved in your browser is your Motion on or off choice, and it never leaves your device.</li>
        <li>Fonts and images are served from this site, not from another company.</li>
        <li>If we turn on a bot check (Cloudflare Turnstile), it will load only on pages with a form.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>Links to Google Maps, Instagram, X, Patreon, TopDeck and Wizards open other sites with their own rules.</p>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="del-h">
      <h2 id="del-h">Ask us to delete your data</h2>
      <p>Send a message from the <a href="/visit/#contact">contact form</a> with the email you used and what you want removed. We will delete the matching rows.</p>
    </section>
  </div>
</Base>
